{"v":4,"catch":"招募、佈陣、打造組合，在這款 Roguelike 自動戰鬥遊戲中稱王！\n帶領你的戰團通過策略對抗，解放諸王國。","desc":"Knightica 是一款回合制 Roguelike 自動戰鬥遊戲，你將領導一支強力部隊解放諸王國。招募勇士、巧妙佈置，搭配默契組合來擊敗一波波怪物與首領。從指揮官、部隊、商店到遭遇，每個選擇都改變你的冒險。升級部隊、收集惡魔之魂，釋放強大附魔與策略。三思而後動，決定世界命運。","publisher":"Entalto Publishing","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["策略","格鬥","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 1.7GB / Switch 1.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/462842d176acd4fd906d21c5fe849cd6ed002080323d420b1b7c8d4db8aada7e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aee99d035d8d75f309716adc387b28614a1b3e9f4ba95614225d5e26d99690ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4fd0a8bd82c44805da5124c6e88b5f9fae692f871131df58a8dcd481f95b55ff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55f6a7ee4a794eb79a534b930ccfdb500be89524751baf1c4f6169d3cb0b39f1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff114ffffcb56b9aa3eabec71c3fa313fb68dd0c703bc02e8e7752de6927fc4f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d26f075c2660392de6a9cd02a7b8d509d2bc264cc4f3bbaa2a008df078aa9baa.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f31024666000","dlc":[]}